? n
A small elf walks around a corner, glances around nervously,
then cautiously walks over to you. "I shouldn't be telling
you this", he quietly whispers, "but there is a word that
you should know if you happen to run into any dwarves. The
word is another name for the Thunderbird only reversed. It is-"
Suddenly and without warning a flaming arrow flies from nowhere
and strikes the elf in the back. A giant hand reaches from the
cave floor and pulls the elf into nowhere.

